 Anna Serdyuchenko asahimae@gmail.com
 
 
 Spectrometer:   Echelle Spectrometer ESA 4000 and Bruker HR 120 FTS 
 Double jacket quartz cell, thermo-insulated, pre-cooler, cryogenic cooling 
 Spectral Resolution(HWHM):	0.01 nm below 290 nm, 
				1 cm-1 between 290 nm and 350 nm, 
				0.01 nm between 350 nm and 450 nm, 
				1 cm-1 between 450 nm and 1100 nm,
 Grid: interpolated on grid 0.01 nm
 
 Absolute calibration: using pure ozone pressure in Huggins and Chappuis bands.
 Uncertainty for absolute measurements at 50 mbar and 193 - 293K and path length 270 cm:
 Systematic  uncertainty	 
   Ozone impurity:
     oxygen purity 99.995% 
     leaks <0.1%. 
   Accuracy of pressure sensors: 0.04% (0.02 mb) 
   Offset of the internal  temperature sensors: <0.3-0.5% (1K) 
   Cell length:  <0.07% (<1 mm)

 Statistical uncertainty
   Ozone decay <1%
   Fluctuations of pressure:  < 0.08% (<0.04mb) 
   Fluctuations of temperature: <0.1 -  0.16% (<0.3K)
   Cooling efficiency: <0.3 - 1.6% (1-3K) 
   Source intensity drift and white noise 0.1 - 70%
 
